        "original_id": "e6643f58-3b9c-5978-82d7-d0917bb5789d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kim Wilson, Chino Moreno, Colin James, Sergio Vega\n- Bands and Projects: The Fabulous Thunderbirds, Deftones, Team Sleep, Crosses, Saudade, Palms\n- Songs and Works: \"Tuff Enuff\", \"Wrap It Up\", \"My Kind Of Evil\", \"Tempest\"\n- Organizations and Platforms: PureVolume\n\nFacts:\n- Kim Wilson is best known as the lead vocalist and frontman for The Fabulous Thunderbirds on the 1980s hit songs \"Tuff Enuff\" and \"Wrap It Up.\"\n- Chino Moreno, born Camillo Wong Moreno on June 20, 1973, is an American musician.\n- Chino Moreno is best known as the lead vocalist and contributing guitarist of Deftones.\n- Chino Moreno is also a member of the side-project groups Team Sleep, Crosses, Saudade, and Palms.\n- \"My Kind Of Evil\" was produced by multi-Grammy nominee Kim Wilson, the singer for The Fabulous Thunderbirds, and features fellow Canadian Colin James on two tracks.\n- On October 3, 2012, the song \"Tempest\" debuted on PureVolume's official website with a video featuring Deftones members Chino Moreno and Sergio Vega discussing the track.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
