        "text": "Page: Kim Wilson. Sentence: He is best known as the lead vocalist and frontman for the Fabulous Thunderbirds on two hit songs of the 1980s, \"Tuff Enuff\" and \"Wrap It Up.\"\nPage: Chino Moreno. Sentence: Chino Moreno (born Camillo Wong Moreno; June 20, 1973) is an American musician.\nPage: Chino Moreno. Sentence: He is best known as the lead vocalist and contributing guitarist of Deftones.\nPage: Chino Moreno. Sentence: He is also a member of the side-project groups Team Sleep, Crosses, Saudade, and Palms.\nPage: My Kind Of Evil. Sentence: It was produced by multi-Grammy nominee Kim Wilson (singer for The Fabulous Thunderbirds) and features fellow Canadian Colin James on two tracks.\nPage: Tempest (Deftones song). Sentence: The song debuted on PureVolume's official website on October 3, 2012 along with a video featuring band members Chino Moreno and Sergio Vega giving some insight regarding the track.",
